{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"agent_message","text":"The winning profile still spends about 9% in depthwise convolution plus two separate SiLU passes, and another sizable fraction constructing triangular decay matrices through masks and scans. I’m first fusing the four-tap causal convolution and its BF16 SiLU into one tiled kernel; this is independent of the validated grouped scan and easy to benchmark locally before risking an attempt."}}
