{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"agent_message","text":"The convolution arithmetic itself is aligned; the mismatch comes from Triton’s fast approximate sigmoid, which changes about one quarter of BF16 SiLU values by one ULP and then propagates through the scan. I’m replacing only that approximation with the accurate ROCm device exponential and rechecking both accuracy and the measured gain."}}
